@Notifications_HostAddress = http://localhost:8083
@userId = user123
@notificationId = 123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000

### Health Check
GET {{Notifications_HostAddress}}/api/notifications

### Create a notification
POST {{Notifications_HostAddress}}/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "type": 2,
  "title": "Welcome to PixPro",
  "message": "This is your first notification!",
  "metadata": {
    "source": "manual-test"
  }
}

### Get notification by ID
GET {{Notifications_HostAddress}}/api/notifications/{{notificationId}}

### Get user notifications (paginated)
GET {{Notifications_HostAddress}}/api/notifications/user/{{userId}}?pageSize=20&page=1

### Get unread notifications for user
GET {{Notifications_HostAddress}}/api/notifications/user/{{userId}}/unread

### Get unread count for user
GET {{Notifications_HostAddress}}/api/notifications/user/{{userId}}/unread-count

### Mark notification as read
PUT {{Notifications_HostAddress}}/api/notifications/{{notificationId}}/read

### Mark all notifications as read for user
PUT {{Notifications_HostAddress}}/api/notifications/user/{{userId}}/read-all

### Delete notification
DELETE {{Notifications_HostAddress}}/api/notifications/{{notificationId}}
